Yes, we do a lot of website projects with WordPress. That doesn’t mean we are restricted to that technology! It just means we know it very well, and quite frankly, that is the most frequent reason developers diss other technologies. Also, we want to give the buzzword "network" real meaning. We work as a network because we want to work as freely as possible. No agency lifestyle, no overhead, no being forced to work crazy hours for some kind of boss. Yes, we live with the disadvantage of clients thinking we can’t deliver the work they need because of the stories agencies have told them over the years. We believe our work speaks for itself.
